<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/18/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Limited Liability Partnerships (Amendment) Act 2014."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/18/eng@> .
